title: gh-actions
abstract: >
  Shared GitHub Actions and reusable workflows for the ivan-pinatti-labs
  merge pipeline. One configurable implementation of the pin-only diff check
  and the CodeRabbit review verdict, published as composite actions, plus the
  gate and bot auto-merge workflows that use them, so a fix lands once and
  reaches every consumer through a pinned SHA bump.
